LaTeX engine: third-party notices
=================================

The scenario builder compiles LaTeX in the browser with a WebAssembly build
of TeX Live. The deploy fetches it into web/core/busytex/ from a release of
TeXlyre/texlyre-busytex; it is not stored in this repository. The release
number is BUSYTEX_ENGINE_VERSION in web/vendor.env.
The versions and source links below come from versions.txt in that release;
update them when BUSYTEX_ENGINE_VERSION changes.

The same terms cover web/shared/texmf/carried-texmf.bin, which holds TeX Live
files taken from that release.


